<title>USA: RSI in pact with Canon Sales.</title>
<headline>RSI in pact with Canon Sales.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>RSI Inc said Thursday it signed an agreement giving exclusive rights to Canon Sales Co Inc of Tokyo to resell RSI's Eris 1000 desktop videoconferencing system in Japan.</p>
<p>RSI develops full-motion video and audio communication, document collaboration and high-speed file transfer systems.</p>
<p>Canon Sales will sell the systems under the Eris trademark through its direct sales force and more than 80 Canon 0-1 retail stores. Canon Sales is the sole distributor of Canon products in Japan.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
